<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON SINGLES CHAMPIONS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON SINGLES CHAMPIONS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
